1
00:00:00,159 --> 00:00:01,919
En el acelerador de particulas.

2
00:00:04,363 --> 00:00:06,593
(Sheldon:)Bueno, mi amigo.

3
00:00:09,035 --> 00:00:11,595
(Penny:)No, no. We're not playing
some dumb, made-up game.

4
00:00:11,837 --> 00:00:13,537
(Sheldon:)All games are made up.

5
00:00:13,706 --> 00:00:17,196
(Sheldon:)They're not found in nature.
You don't just dig in the ground...

6
00:00:17,410 --> 00:00:20,040
(Sheldon:)...come across a rich vein
of Rock 'Em Sock 'Em Robots.

7
00:00:21,247 --> 00:00:23,907
(Penny:)- Pick another game.
- Why don't we do something athletic?

8
00:00:24,083 --> 00:00:26,953
(Amy:)Like, go over to the university pool
and play water polo?

9
00:00:27,119 --> 00:00:29,589
(Leonard:)No good, Sheldon doesn't float.

10
00:00:30,356 --> 00:00:33,686
(Sheldon:)That is true.
I have a higher than normal body density.

11
00:00:33,893 --> 00:00:36,623
(Sheldon:)If I run too deep a bath, I drown.

12
00:00:37,630 --> 00:00:41,090
- All right, let's keep it simple. Darts?
- No, that's not fair, either.

13
00:00:41,300 --> 00:00:43,790
- Why not?
- Darts is a bar game.

14
00:00:44,036 --> 00:00:47,936
(Sheldon:)You've been frequenting drinking
establishments since you were of legal age.

15
00:00:48,574 --> 00:00:51,304
(Leonard:)Yeah, that's when it started.

16
00:00:52,278 --> 00:00:56,438
(Sheldon:)Well, regardless, she has a distinct
advantage in all tavern-based competitions.

17
00:00:56,615 --> 00:00:59,745
Pool, beer-pong, wet T-shirt contests.
They're all out.

